(7420677, 1171109, 141429, '<td valign="top">I like this shot- the light (I assume sun) adds much interest. Completely personal preference, but I think I would like it more if the kids were frame such that their heads were placed further to the upper right thus showing more of their shadow in the image and putting more of the negative space where the subjects are looking (opposed to behind them). Good shot.</td>', 'I like this shot- the light (I assume sun) adds much interest. Completely personal preference, but I think I would like it more if the kids were frame such that their heads were placed further to the upper right thus showing more of their shadow in the image and putting more of the negative space where the subjects are looking (opposed to behind them). Good shot.', '2015-12-06 10:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7420679, 1170903, 141429, '<td valign="top">The helicopter looks funny with such a fast shutter speed to freeze the blades.</td>', 'The helicopter looks funny with such a fast shutter speed to freeze the blades.', '2015-12-06 11:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
