(7421123, 1171022, 96574, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> This is very interesting. Have you entered it before? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yep, actually used it twice before in the past 5 yrs.  It''s fairly close to my house and didn''t have anything for FS this month so shot this the day before the end of the month.  I''m still not quite satisfied with any of the versions I''ve done.</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: This is very interesting. Have you entered it before?   Yep, actually used it twice before in the past 5 yrs.  It''s fairly close to my house and didn''t have anything for FS this month so shot this the day before the end of the month.  I''m still not quite satisfied with any of the versions I''ve done.', '2015-12-08 01:02:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7421125, 1171142, 170018, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tnun:</b></div><hr/><i> I love how the warning figure looks like a lion. somehow. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I know, it''s funny!<br/>In reality it was not hostile or warning at all, it was a farewell gesture, and this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1171500" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/170000-174999/170018/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1171500.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/170000-174999/170018/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1171500.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/170000-174999/170018/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1171500.jpg"/></a> was just few seconds before. :-)</td>', 'Originally posted by tnun: I love how the warning figure looks like a lion. somehow.  I know, it''s funny!In reality it was not hostile or warning at all, it was a farewell gesture, and this  was just few seconds before. :-)', '2015-12-08 01:25:00.000000', NULL, 0),
