(7421169, 1171032, 16148, '<td valign="top">8 from me.  I''m assuming this was a candid shot?  I''d like to see the man in full stride (could be dangerous on the ice) and a little lower so he wasn''t on the horizon line.  Besides that, I wouldn''t change a thing.  Very nice!</td>', '8 from me.  I''m assuming this was a candid shot?  I''d like to see the man in full stride (could be dangerous on the ice) and a little lower so he wasn''t on the horizon line.  Besides that, I wouldn''t change a thing.  Very nice!', '2015-12-08 10:13:29.000000', NULL, 0),
