(7421171, 1171148, 112739, '<td valign="top">Well done. I also would have awarded an extra point for fixing the lighter area around the trees and sky. But the rest is pure perfection. Congrats on HM!</td>', 'Well done. I also would have awarded an extra point for fixing the lighter area around the trees and sky. But the rest is pure perfection. Congrats on HM!', '2015-12-08 10:15:34.000000', NULL, 0),
