(7421176, 1170084, 128323, '<td valign="top">Sounds like you had a great trip, Dennis.  And what a shot you came home with!  So jealous!  Congrats on the FS ribbon!</td>', 'Sounds like you had a great trip, Dennis.  And what a shot you came home with!  So jealous!  Congrats on the FS ribbon!', '2015-12-08 10:23:54.000000', NULL, 0),
